_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/04a12813f1abdcbc4adfcac998ed7836.webm?t=1771618410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/04a12813f1abdcbc4adfcac998ed7836.mp4?t=1771618410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work for the merchants, haggling with customers to earn a profit. Save up to purchase your own stalls to start growing your own businesses on the side.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/9372ec36580b94bd355113c233ea944e.webp?t=1771618410\" width=750 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/54779e435a1feb5e5ca799147ed00f25.poster.avif?t=1771618410\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/54779e435a1feb5e5ca799147ed00f25.webm?t=1771618410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/54779e435a1feb5e5ca799147ed00f25.mp4?t=1771618410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your time off (in the evening and on free days), you can choose how to spend your time. Whether that's catching fish, diving for clams and treasure, or figuring out the mystery of your past. Just make sure to pay back the Dock King .. or you may be in for a rough time.</p>","developers":["City Wizard Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/63f44b8ed7c8fb0f3d7a01eac137070cf5d79dd0/header.jpg?t=1771618410","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[